{"seq":2,"slug":"container-orchestration","title":"容器与编排安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/container-orchestration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"container-image-security","title":"容器镜像安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/container-orchestration/container-image-security","wordCount":2214,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"kubernetes-security","title":"Kubernetes安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/container-orchestration/kubernetes-security","wordCount":2251,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"service-mesh-security","title":"服务网格安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/cloud-native-security/container-orchestration/service-mesh-security","wordCount":2290,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"容器与编排安全\">容器与编排安全</h1><p>容器与 Kubernetes 编排是云原生应用的核心运行时环境，也是攻击者最常寻找突破口的攻击面。本章从容器镜像的构建安全出发，讲解镜像扫描、SBOM 生成与签名验证等供应链防护手段；然后深入 Kubernetes 集群的安全架构，覆盖 RBAC、网络策略、Pod 安全标准与准入控制等关键防护机制；最后探讨服务网格如何通过 mTLS 与流量授权策略，在微服务间建立细粒度的零信任网络。</p>\n<p>本章内容建立在第一章的云安全模型与零信任框架之上——Kubernetes 的 NetworkPolicy 是零信任&quot;永不信任、始终验证&quot;原则在网络层的具体实现，而服务网格的 sidecar 模式则是零信任架构在数据面的工程落地。</p>\n"}